%S A079572 1,1,2,5,10,26,70,284,1405,9868,90892,1144131,19425146,445781177,
%T A079572 13743625352,566756900592,31125101479940
%N A079572 Number of unlabeled, connected graphs on n vertices with no induced subgraph isomorphic to a paw, where the paw is the graph on 4 vertices, 3 of which form a triangle and the 4th vertex is adjacent to exactly one of those 3.
%D A079572 S. Olariu, Paw-free graphs, Information Processing Letters 28 (1988), 53-54.
%H A079572 F. Hüffner, <a href="https://github.com/falk-hueffner/tinygraph">tinygraph</a>, software for generating integer sequences based on graph properties, version 39d0919.
%F A079572 a(n) = A024607(n) + A004250(n): by Olariu's theorem a connected paw-free graph is triangle-free or complete multipartite, and the complete multipartite graphs that are not already triangle-free are those with at least 3 parts. - _Jonathan Carroll_, Oct 16 2026
%Y A079572 Cf. A024607, A004250.
%K A079572 more,nonn,changed
%O A079572 1,3
%A A079572 _Jim Nastos_, Jan 24 2003
